1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Huangshan is in cloud 200 days a year. I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
Show up on the wrong day...

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,600
and you pay 190 yuan to stare at fog.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,000
These granite peaks are China's most-painted mountain.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
Pines grow straight out of bare rock.

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,800
But the prize is the sea of clouds.

7
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,200
It floods the valleys and floats the peaks.

8
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,800
Double-tap if you'd climb up for this.

9
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,200
The catch: clouds love winter and early spring.

10
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,400
★ Expert Tip: climb the morning after light rain, Nov to March.

11
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,200
So would you risk the fog for the clouds? Comment.
